{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Huuu~&quot; is a 30-minute healing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the days of recovery from illness, the protagonist begins to communicate with the wind. Guided by the breeze, they embark on a journey through the memories of the four seasons\u2014healing old wounds and awakening the courage to reconcile with themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending natural aesthetics with adventure and puzzle-solving, the game introduces a unique form of natural interaction: <i>breathing</i>. Players take on the role of a breeze in <i>Hoo~</i>, accompanying and aiding the protagonist on their journey. The wind has shape and emotion\u2014every breath resonates with the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players control the character\u2019s actions and environmental changes through the intensity and rhythm of their breath. Breathing directly influences the world\u2019s dynamics: a gentle, long breath sets feathers dancing through the air; a steady, short puff pushes the character forward; and a warm exhale can awaken slumbering plants and spirits.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Autumn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718230/49d39b04a137dfe277bfcb3df36d67972ccdde00.jpg"},{"name":"Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718230/0ba60f2d0377d8aec31c9a201ee770946b8dff9d.jpg"},{"name":"Spring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718230/729275eddf6eba47d7d5c592c7047cae5e14b986.jpg"},{"name":"Summer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718230/d29ee9408216476e40123d9ee4fe6b12a7accbf1.jpg"},{"name":"A Dream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3718230/f02d8c386a167196527de758c622b6a3dd963dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Cycle of Seasons","path":"https://cdn.akamai.st